Report parse, type and lint diagnostics

Usage: redextape lint [OPTIONS] <PATHS>...

Arguments:
  <PATHS>...  Files to check. `-` reads standard input

Options:
      --config <PATH>     Read settings from this file instead of searching for one. Naming a file that does not exist is an error, where finding no file during the search is not
      --deny-warnings     Make a warning fail the run: exit 1 rather than 0. Overrides `lint.deny-warnings` in `redextape.toml`
      --no-config         Ignore any `redextape.toml` and use built-in defaults
      --no-deny-warnings  Report warnings without failing, overriding `lint.deny-warnings` in `redextape.toml`
  -h, --help              Print help
